{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/bai-lian-gang.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-04-90", "entity": "百炼钢", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:f4ba9a9633350b5b127069f792c3d049a3be4efd387f963c553f65a5435b03a5", "bytes": 4420, "lines": 80, "note": "新建metalworking_technique：秦汉（西汉中期普遍）；块铁多次加热锻打，杂质减少、体积变小、韧度与强度加大而转化为钢；百炼成钢"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/chao-gang.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-04-91", "entity": "炒钢", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:8f1863b5ce712b5e0fd884c09b0b6da2e3fea1ba23346701c4bb2e30367dfb44", "bytes": 3638, "lines": 78, "note": "新建metalworking_technique：西汉中期；生铁加热、添入矿石搅拌以降低含炭程度，再锻制，提高百炼钢制器的速度和质量"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/chromate-oxidation-treatment.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-04-93", "entity": "铬盐氧化防锈处理", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:fdf1b5e9b2f5177b835cf21b693da02d343e0ef7b195f48f1c0de7b995496df9", "bytes": 3735, "lines": 77, "note": "新建metalworking_technique：秦代；秦俑坑青铜剑剑身脊刃对称，表面经铬盐氧化防锈处理，出土后仍寒光闪烁"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/zaozhishu.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-05-19", "entity": "造纸术", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:2aab13b512e60f4cdd7acefa008e0ad0c6f253ea7004df0468aed88caff27fe5", "bytes": 5177, "lines": 83, "note": "新建papermaking_technique：西汉出现；东汉蔡伦改进；以树肤、麻头、敝布、鱼网造纸；元兴元年奏上，天下称蔡侯纸；西汉麻纸见于罗布泊与灞桥"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/han-dai-qiqi-zhizuo-fengong.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-05-35", "entity": "汉代漆器制作分工", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:ab38683d6a86bcf5719144a2e34d97fd10e02cf15d02991d26d8b17eecfd2e22", "bytes": 4341, "lines": 80, "note": "新建lacquer_technique：汉代；漆器铭文见素工、髹工、上工、黄涂工、画工、雕工、清工、供工、造工等工种，分工细致"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/huodong-lianchuang-zhimo.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-05-54", "entity": "活动帘床纸模抄纸法", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:f8384d662170f4cbaa33d0e15fbebb633f49ef259743e490a423842052c3594f", "bytes": 5119, "lines": 84, "note": "新建papermaking_technique：三国以后；竹帘置框架中连续抄捞湿纸并晾晒；纸药、施胶、涂布提高纸张性能"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/ran-zhi.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-05-56", "entity": "染纸（潢纸）", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:64adb0bc2615186d9b90493a6f51ee21d5d9a08f85d9f8b7b8f967f50e3d7284", "bytes": 4226, "lines": 85, "note": "新建papermaking_technique：东汉开始；魏晋沿用；黄柏皮中的柏碱加入纸浆染纸，增美观并防虫蛀；《齐民要术》记潢纸不宜太深"}
